WEBVTT

00:16.210 --> 00:18.830
Let the banquet of slaughter begin.

00:18.960 --> 00:21.960
Crush them all, Archfiend Ragnarok!

00:27.580 --> 00:29.250
A rose that blooms in the sky...

00:29.250 --> 00:30.670
A bat enveloped in flames...

00:30.670 --> 00:32.670
A band of light that razes the earth...

00:33.130 --> 00:35.130
Each of these things is really quite rare.

00:36.210 --> 00:37.750
But they are unsightly.

00:43.210 --> 00:44.460
Lady Alpha...

00:44.460 --> 00:46.380
We have an urgent report from Oriana.

00:46.750 --> 00:48.500
The Black Rose has activated.

00:52.130 --> 00:54.830
The destruction that precedes creation has begun.

00:55.580 --> 00:57.710
Wanna send a ship?

00:58.210 --> 01:00.330
The city will probably fall before it gets there, though.

01:02.040 --> 01:03.290
That's all right.

01:03.290 --> 01:04.880
It will all work out.

01:05.710 --> 01:07.130
After all, he's there.

01:19.210 --> 01:20.880
Even considering you had the element of surprise,

01:20.880 --> 01:23.830
I'm impressed that you managed to injure Ragnarok.

01:24.210 --> 01:26.710
All right, I'll ask: Who are you?

01:31.880 --> 01:33.670
We are Shadow Garden.

01:33.880 --> 01:36.830
They who lurk in the shadows
in order to hunt the shadows.

01:47.080 --> 01:48.290
Go.

01:48.540 --> 01:51.210
There are things you must accomplish,
are there not?

01:52.250 --> 01:53.460
Yes, my lord!

02:11.710 --> 02:14.170
So you overestimated your own power.

02:14.460 --> 02:15.920
You were a fool.

02:15.920 --> 02:18.460
I hope this teaches you to know your place.

02:18.460 --> 02:20.960
We'll see who the fool is soon enough.

02:21.830 --> 02:23.500
I believe this is our first meeting,

02:23.500 --> 02:27.670
Sir Mordred, Knight Beyond Men,
Ninth Seat of Rounds?

02:28.210 --> 02:30.580
We haven't known each other long,
but we're going to kill you.

02:30.920 --> 02:33.830
But first, we're going to need you
to confirm some things for us.

02:34.130 --> 02:36.040
Lowly guinea pigs.

02:36.250 --> 02:38.670
I told you to learn your place.

02:41.130 --> 02:42.880
An invisible sword stroke...

02:43.580 --> 02:44.580
I see.

02:44.580 --> 02:47.210
So that's why they call you the Knight Beyond Men.

02:47.210 --> 02:48.500
Indeed it is.

02:48.750 --> 02:51.290
My fencing style is one that
cannot be seen by mortal eyes.

02:51.290 --> 02:53.580
I am impressed that you managed
to dodge a single strike-

02:53.580 --> 02:55.040
The Invisible Blade...

02:56.000 --> 02:59.130
An ancient elven artifact that unleashes
an unseeable sword.

02:59.130 --> 03:01.920
Bragging about a stolen achievement...

03:01.920 --> 03:04.830
I suppose that's par for the course
for the Cult of Diablos.

03:05.210 --> 03:07.960
Your armor and even your cape are artifacts, too?

03:07.960 --> 03:09.750
My, what a coward you are.

03:10.420 --> 03:12.670
Out of grief for our dying homeland,

03:12.670 --> 03:15.830
an elven swordsmith risked
life and limb to forge that blade.

03:15.830 --> 03:17.210
We'll be taking it back now.

03:17.710 --> 03:19.460
Mind your tongue!

03:21.420 --> 03:22.630
What?!

03:24.380 --> 03:25.630
A blade of magical energy!

03:25.630 --> 03:27.830
An artifact I don't know about?

03:27.830 --> 03:32.630
The Wisdom we have been granted is beyond
anything that one of your ilk can comprehend.

03:32.630 --> 03:35.630
Now, you will share with us
all your musty old knowledge.

03:35.920 --> 03:39.000
If you refuse, things might start to sting a little.

03:39.330 --> 03:41.000
Foolish peasants!

03:41.000 --> 03:42.580
You think you can hurt me?!

03:43.290 --> 03:44.960
We don't stand a chance! Run!

03:45.210 --> 03:47.130
Running around in circles won't help anything!

03:57.290 --> 03:59.290
That was the last one inside the castle!

04:00.130 --> 04:01.330
What about in town?

04:08.830 --> 04:10.960
I'll just have to trust them to handle it.

04:10.960 --> 04:12.170
Princess Rose!

04:12.630 --> 04:14.630
Margaret, are you all right?

04:14.630 --> 04:16.290
Yes! Um...

04:16.290 --> 04:17.790
Princess Rose, I-

04:17.790 --> 04:19.330
I'm glad you're here, Margaret.

04:19.580 --> 04:21.540
I need you to unlock the cellar under the garden.

04:21.540 --> 04:24.080
It was built in ancient times and very sturdy.

04:24.080 --> 04:26.040
The castle residents can take refuge there.

04:27.250 --> 04:29.830
I will rally the knights and lead them into town.

04:30.130 --> 04:34.040
We at least have to do whatever
we can to rescue the citizens.

04:35.330 --> 04:36.540
Is something wrong?

04:38.170 --> 04:39.460
No.

04:39.460 --> 04:41.330
I hear and I obey.

04:41.540 --> 04:43.750
I will take care of everything here.

04:43.750 --> 04:46.790
Please, do whatever you feel is right...

04:47.040 --> 04:48.250
Queen Rose.

04:56.210 --> 04:57.710
That's a fantasy world for you.

04:57.710 --> 04:59.630
Even their bats are ginormous.

05:01.380 --> 05:03.250
Yeah, this is a disaster.

05:03.250 --> 05:05.290
Insane magic, insane power...

05:05.290 --> 05:07.670
This is what makes monster fights so impossible.

05:12.250 --> 05:13.670
You singed my bangs.

05:14.000 --> 05:17.460
With stuff like this, you want to start by hitting hard,
then just go with the flow.

05:17.460 --> 05:19.580
Didn't you learn that in school?

05:23.290 --> 05:25.330
The skies are under my control.

05:25.670 --> 05:26.960
Savage beast,

05:26.960 --> 05:28.920
let that truth be carved into your soul!

05:32.250 --> 05:33.250
Well, bye.

05:33.250 --> 05:34.250
You can do it!

05:34.250 --> 05:35.920
Yes, good luck to us all.

05:37.580 --> 05:38.920
How goes the evacuation?

05:39.170 --> 05:42.170
We are currently organizing a search
and rescue team to send into town.

05:42.170 --> 05:45.960
But about your orders to let them
handle the magical creatures...

05:46.630 --> 05:49.750
Are you really sure we can trust those people?

05:52.040 --> 05:54.830
Yes, if we have proven our worth to them.

05:55.380 --> 05:59.040
And I am certain we can do that
by spilling our own blood.

06:00.040 --> 06:01.290
Now is the time to act.

06:01.290 --> 06:02.290
Yes, my queen!

06:04.460 --> 06:07.170
Shadow is fighting Ragnarok.

06:08.580 --> 06:10.670
As for the man called Mordred...

06:14.210 --> 06:15.420
Mordred!

06:16.330 --> 06:17.540
How?!

06:17.750 --> 06:19.170
I see you're working hard.

06:19.920 --> 06:22.250
L-Lady Beta, and...

06:22.250 --> 06:23.710
Epsilon.

06:23.710 --> 06:26.380
Damn, to think you'd be this strong...

06:27.380 --> 06:29.290
Bested by a pair of little girls...

06:29.290 --> 06:32.880
Please don't try to tell me that you only lost
because it was two against one.

06:32.880 --> 06:34.960
It was foolish of you to try to rely on your toys

06:34.960 --> 06:37.540
when you knew you were
at a numerical disadvantage.

06:38.630 --> 06:39.880
It's not over yet.

06:39.880 --> 06:41.880
I still have Ragnarok.

06:41.880 --> 06:44.880
With the greatest power ever
recorded at my command,

06:44.880 --> 06:47.630
I can take down the likes of you in a single instant!

06:48.170 --> 06:50.580
That instant seems awfully far away.

06:51.040 --> 06:53.920
If that's what you want, we'd be happy to wait.

06:54.170 --> 06:56.750
But in the meantime, we hope you'll
confirm some things for us.

06:57.040 --> 06:58.250
What?

06:58.250 --> 06:59.920
We told you at the start, remember?

06:59.920 --> 07:02.420
That you will share all of your knowledge with us?

07:02.790 --> 07:07.290
About the Black Rose,
the magical beasts, and the Cult?

07:07.580 --> 07:09.130
And you think I'll tell you?

07:09.460 --> 07:13.580
If you're so sure that Ragnarok is going to beat us,
then there's no problem, is there?

07:13.580 --> 07:15.170
Or are you scared?

07:15.460 --> 07:18.710
Afraid that your precious research specimen
might be defeated?

07:19.960 --> 07:21.170
Very well.

07:22.380 --> 07:26.250
In the very brief moments before
Ragnarok incinerates you,

07:26.250 --> 07:29.080
I will allow you to be
auditing students of my sagacity.

07:30.580 --> 07:32.380
Surely you are already aware that,

07:32.380 --> 07:35.500
outside of our world,
there exist countless other worlds.

07:35.960 --> 07:38.670
I assume you're not talking about
space and other planets.

07:38.670 --> 07:41.210
No, I'm talking about different dimensions.

07:41.500 --> 07:45.460
We call the worlds that exist in
those dimensions, "Realms."

07:46.380 --> 07:49.960
For example,  a "world of ice" that
extends to the ends of the earth...

07:49.960 --> 07:52.210
A "world of poison" where no living thing can survive...

07:52.210 --> 07:54.210
A burning "world of flame..."

07:54.210 --> 07:57.210
A "world of death," with every inch covered
by colorless tombstones...

07:58.250 --> 08:01.830
And a world inhabited by beasts that
possess enormous magical powers.

08:04.080 --> 08:09.790
These various worlds that we call Realms
revolve around a certain single point.

08:09.790 --> 08:13.580
And our world, too,
is one of the worlds orbiting that center.

08:13.750 --> 08:15.380
What's at the center?

08:15.380 --> 08:16.580
Who knows?

08:16.580 --> 08:18.000
Perhaps some sort of god.

08:18.000 --> 08:20.170
Which is to say, you haven't been able to observe it.

08:20.170 --> 08:23.500
No, I am merely saying we are currently
in the process of observing it.

08:24.540 --> 08:26.960
Stop making idle comments during my lesson.

08:27.790 --> 08:30.380
What lies at the center is not important now.

08:30.750 --> 08:34.080
The problem is that countless worlds
do revolve around it.

08:34.420 --> 08:39.380
Around and around, for months, for years,
the worlds follow their courses.

08:39.710 --> 08:41.330
Occasionally, they collide.

08:41.670 --> 08:45.630
When they do, the differing worlds
become connected.

08:46.000 --> 08:49.830
Allow me to give you an example of
what could happen as a result.

08:50.000 --> 08:52.960
We once studied the ancient strata of our planet,

08:52.960 --> 08:57.710
and discovered that, before a certain period of time,
magic did not exist in this world.

08:57.710 --> 08:59.750
And that period of time is?

08:59.750 --> 09:02.630
Exactly when our world collided with a Realm.

09:02.830 --> 09:06.750
In other words, magic flowed into
our world from that Realm.

09:07.040 --> 09:11.500
As a result, our world's biosphere
underwent a dramatic change.

09:12.080 --> 09:14.500
And that led to the decline of the dragons.

09:14.920 --> 09:17.880
Exactly ten million years ago.

09:18.170 --> 09:22.080
They couldn't adapt to the magic
that flowed into our world from the other.

09:22.460 --> 09:26.210
And those that could adapt to the new environment

09:26.210 --> 09:28.670
began to flourish in the dragons' stead.

09:28.920 --> 09:30.670
The humanoid races...

09:30.670 --> 09:33.880
But a certain question remains about this theory.

09:34.460 --> 09:36.790
Could it be that we humans, too,

09:36.790 --> 09:41.710
like the magic and its creatures,
came here from other worlds?

09:42.130 --> 09:43.330
Humans, too?

09:43.330 --> 09:46.920
There are still unanswered questions
about the races we call human.

09:47.210 --> 09:50.880
We are the only species with this much
intellect that have managed to thrive.

09:50.880 --> 09:52.170
We're different.

09:52.170 --> 09:55.420
Could we really, truly be inhabitants of this world?

09:56.750 --> 09:58.830
Magical creatures, magical power,

09:58.830 --> 10:01.290
the various humanoid races that
have command over them...

10:01.540 --> 10:05.790
Since ancient times, all of these things and more
have come into this world from other Realms.

10:05.790 --> 10:11.080
But in that same vein, some things have gone
out of this world into those other Realms.

10:11.080 --> 10:12.330
Spirited away.

10:12.920 --> 10:14.130
Exactly.

10:14.630 --> 10:19.670
Once upon a time, there was an island kingdom
that vanished without a trace.

10:20.080 --> 10:22.250
That kingdom was called Atlantis.

10:22.250 --> 10:23.790
Where did it go?

10:24.290 --> 10:25.630
To a Realm?

10:25.630 --> 10:27.920
This is an empirically proven fact.

10:28.170 --> 10:31.630
This world and the Realms are
influencing each other equally.

10:32.130 --> 10:35.210
Then did the Demon Diablos
come from one of these Realms?

10:35.500 --> 10:39.790
That demon was most certainly
a product our own world.

10:40.500 --> 10:42.460
But its original was not.

10:43.040 --> 10:47.330
The creature that became the basis for the
Demon Diablos was a visitor from a Realm.

10:47.710 --> 10:51.670
We call that world the First Realm.

10:52.460 --> 10:53.670
First?

10:53.880 --> 10:56.330
We gained several pieces of wisdom from him.

10:56.580 --> 10:58.380
That is one of them.

10:58.710 --> 11:01.920
Surely, now you realize what that is.

11:02.380 --> 11:05.250
An artificial gate to another Realm.

11:05.830 --> 11:09.670
The Oriana Kingdom once opened that gate
by coincidence,

11:09.670 --> 11:14.080
and destroyed the hundred thousand Velgaltan soldiers
that surrounded its capital in a single night.

11:14.500 --> 11:17.630
But this kingdom did not come out of
that encounter unscathed.

11:17.630 --> 11:22.040
Magical creatures continued to spill out of the gate,
devouring any humans in their path.

11:22.630 --> 11:26.670
And we came to their rescue by closing the gate.

11:29.080 --> 11:32.040
So it only stands to reason that you
would pay the price, no?

11:32.790 --> 11:34.670
Blood, royal blood...

11:34.670 --> 11:36.170
In this generation, that means you.

11:37.080 --> 11:40.580
Your blood, which is especially high
in magic even for royalty,

11:40.580 --> 11:43.790
should have been offered to the Cult
when you were an infant.

11:44.080 --> 11:46.670
But your foolish king refused to do it.

11:48.130 --> 11:49.420
Father...

11:50.880 --> 11:52.830
You can see what happened as a result.

11:53.580 --> 11:56.670
His ridiculous parental affection
has destroyed Oriana.

11:56.960 --> 12:00.000
Next time, we'll endeavor to build
a somewhat better kingdom.

12:01.000 --> 12:02.540
I won't let you!

12:02.540 --> 12:04.000
I will carry on my father's-

12:04.000 --> 12:06.170
That is for us to decide.

12:06.710 --> 12:11.250
You lowly guinea pig puppets have
no say in this matter.

12:11.580 --> 12:15.250
You and Oriana will soon be no more,
destroyed by Ragnarok,

12:15.250 --> 12:17.250
the Grand Ruler of the Fourth Realm!

12:20.710 --> 12:22.210
The Grand Ruler's arm?

12:35.210 --> 12:37.330
No, it's impossible!

12:38.000 --> 12:40.460
It can't be! That was Ragnarok!

12:40.880 --> 12:43.830
The being of the greatest level
of magic ever witnessed!

12:44.080 --> 12:45.130
And he...

12:45.130 --> 12:47.540
That's impossible!
It just can't happen!

12:48.170 --> 12:50.170
It's not right!
Not right, I say!

12:50.460 --> 12:52.040
A living wonder of the world!

12:52.040 --> 12:54.580
The greatest treasure of all the dimensions!

12:55.170 --> 12:56.380
Poor guy.
That was the vessel capable of becoming the new prime field!<b></b>

12:56.380 --> 12:57.830
If he could have understood the tiniest fraction
That was the vessel capable of becoming the new prime field!<b></b>

12:57.830 --> 12:59.080
of the Wisdom of the Shadows,
That was the vessel capable of becoming the new prime field!<b></b>

12:59.080 --> 13:01.080
this never would have happened.
The potential was there!<b></b>

13:01.580 --> 13:03.170
I'm here to report.
Our theory...<b></b>

13:03.170 --> 13:06.130
We've exterminated all magical beasts in the area.
could have been realized!<b></b>

13:06.420 --> 13:07.630
Good work.

13:07.630 --> 13:09.630
Let's split our troops as planned.

13:10.040 --> 13:12.880
One team to monitor the Rose,
one to assess the damage to the surrounding area.

13:12.880 --> 13:15.500
I'm especially concerned about what
the rebel forces are doing.

13:18.750 --> 13:21.460
This is a dream.
I'm just tired.

13:21.460 --> 13:26.170
Apparently, I have a lot of stress built up
from associating with these barbarians.

13:26.170 --> 13:29.210
Otherwise, I wouldn't be having this nightmare!

13:35.170 --> 13:37.920
That was fun, like fighting a boss in a video game,

13:37.920 --> 13:42.170
but Rose and Mr. Perv and all the
main characters were total no-shows.

13:42.170 --> 13:45.250
I at least need to get a little closer
to the main storyline.

13:48.540 --> 13:50.920
And now you're recycling the same special effects.

14:03.080 --> 14:05.380
Typical defect.

14:11.290 --> 14:13.460
Who are you calling a defect?!

14:20.540 --> 14:21.750
Good grief...

14:24.830 --> 14:27.830
Even the beasts are capable of recognizing
when someone is more powerful.

14:28.380 --> 14:31.000
I'm gonna assign you a rank below Delta.

14:43.170 --> 14:45.500
I've had just about enough of that!

14:50.960 --> 14:52.540
I'll kill you.

14:52.540 --> 14:56.000
I'll kill you!

14:58.170 --> 14:59.540
Where is he?

14:59.540 --> 15:01.460
Where did the bastard go?!

15:01.630 --> 15:02.880
They say...

15:03.380 --> 15:06.210
Long ago, in order to chastise
the humans on Earth,

15:06.580 --> 15:08.880
the gods unleashed lightning from the heavens.

15:09.830 --> 15:12.920
The people were fascinated by this power
that rained down from the sky.

15:12.920 --> 15:14.250
They wanted it for themselves.

15:14.750 --> 15:16.290
"We need that power."

15:16.960 --> 15:19.000
"We must attain that power."

15:19.630 --> 15:21.170
Then, after much dedicated research,

15:21.170 --> 15:24.040
at last, the humans succeeded in obtaining it.

15:24.500 --> 15:25.710
In other words,

15:25.710 --> 15:29.290
the nuclear energy between the protons and neutrons
that make up the atomic nucleus created fission,

15:29.290 --> 15:31.040
and the critical barrier...

15:31.670 --> 15:35.790
Or the exponent, or the function,
or something does some thing,

15:35.790 --> 15:37.460
and there's all this stuff with a chain reaction...

15:37.460 --> 15:40.580
Anyway, a buttload of energy creates
explosive destruction.

15:40.580 --> 15:42.960
But nobody cares how it works.

15:43.380 --> 15:44.790
The far side of the heavens...

15:45.290 --> 15:48.670
The ultimate destruction,
raining down from a soundless world...

15:49.170 --> 15:51.080
The extreme I must surpass...

15:52.250 --> 15:57.040
Seeing this place, feeling it,
I realized again what I must do.

15:59.630 --> 16:01.830
I guess you'd call it
"remembering why you started."

16:02.540 --> 16:03.790
And I owe it all to you.

16:04.580 --> 16:05.790
Thank you.

16:06.210 --> 16:07.420
So, this is it.

16:07.790 --> 16:09.040
I'm done playing.

16:09.790 --> 16:11.080
Because I want to give this everything I have.

16:11.080 --> 16:11.920
Because I want to give this everything I have.
Wait.<b></b>

16:11.920 --> 16:12.170
I hope you'll accept my gratitude.

16:12.170 --> 16:13.000
I hope you'll accept my gratitude.
Stop!<b></b>

16:13.000 --> 16:14.460
What are you doing to me?!

16:14.460 --> 16:16.290
What the hell are you?!

16:18.460 --> 16:19.920
I'm Atomic.

16:21.250 --> 16:22.250
Huh?

16:39.000 --> 16:41.290
It's a little early for dawn.

16:41.960 --> 16:43.250
That must be...

16:43.960 --> 16:45.880
Yes, this is...

16:47.380 --> 16:48.580
So...

16:49.460 --> 16:51.250
that is your choice.

17:06.790 --> 17:08.920
A polar light to dispel the darkness.

17:09.500 --> 17:10.790
But this is so...

17:10.790 --> 17:12.000
It's too much.

17:13.290 --> 17:14.790
My lord and master!

17:26.080 --> 17:27.380
Lord Shadow!

17:29.630 --> 17:33.920
Well, every once in a while, it's not so bad to take
the muscle-headed brute force approach.

17:54.960 --> 17:56.170
What?!

18:10.830 --> 18:12.790
Looking at that moon reminds me...

18:13.500 --> 18:14.750
Of that day...

18:15.290 --> 18:16.500
Of him.

18:19.420 --> 18:20.960
I must have fallen asleep.

18:24.080 --> 18:26.710
I'm in my 20s.
Why am I still wearing a school uniform?

18:28.580 --> 18:30.830
Nishino-san, are you really going?

18:31.210 --> 18:34.170
Yes, I can't abandon my friends.

18:34.420 --> 18:36.250
But at night, they...

18:36.790 --> 18:38.130
I can handle it.

18:38.880 --> 18:42.500
Besides, I want to at least
bring back some mementos.

18:45.750 --> 18:48.420
<i>There was a boy that I despised.</i>

18:49.040 --> 18:50.750
<i>His grades were just below average.</i>

18:51.130 --> 18:52.790
<i>Athletically, he was just below average.</i>

18:53.420 --> 18:55.420
<i>His looks were exceedingly ordinary.</i>

18:55.750 --> 18:58.330
<i>There was absolutely nothing
memorable about him.</i>

18:59.290 --> 19:00.500
<i>And yet...</i>

19:01.460 --> 19:03.420
<i>Looking at that moon reminds me...</i>

19:03.960 --> 19:05.170
<i>Of that day...</i>

19:06.130 --> 19:07.330
<i>Of him.</i>

19:10.750 --> 19:12.460
<i>It's something I always knew.</i>

19:12.460 --> 19:16.380
<i>No one they attack has a chance
of surviving more than a day.</i>

19:18.330 --> 19:19.790
It's getting late.

19:23.710 --> 19:26.460
<i>How long has it been
since I've been all alone?</i>

19:41.250 --> 19:42.710
<i>I must be getting paranoid.</i>

19:47.080 --> 19:51.130
Aka-Akane N-N-Nishi-shi-shi, I presume?

20:08.170 --> 20:09.580
A new invention...

20:10.000 --> 20:12.500
It's supposed to suppress
the oh-so-noble knights' powers.

20:13.170 --> 20:14.670
You know you shouldn't do that.

20:14.670 --> 20:18.580
Even if you are the great Savior,
it's a bad idea to wander the streets alone at night.

20:19.080 --> 20:21.500
You might get caught by some
unsavory characters.

20:22.080 --> 20:26.460
Now that have... have you,
we'll get the d-dru-drugs...

20:26.460 --> 20:28.460
Or that's the cover story, anyway.

20:29.080 --> 20:31.580
What our client really wants is your life.

20:32.040 --> 20:35.290
Seems like the Savior's made a lot of enemies.

20:36.170 --> 20:37.380
Enemies?

20:38.000 --> 20:40.460
Our client wants to do the honors
of killing you personally,

20:40.460 --> 20:42.630
so we're supposed to bring you in alive.

20:42.880 --> 20:44.580
That's asking an awful lot in this day and age.

20:44.580 --> 20:46.170
Kill...
That's asking an awful lot in this day and age.<b></b>

20:46.170 --> 20:47.380
Bad.

20:47.630 --> 20:49.790
Capture, get d-drugs...

20:51.670 --> 20:53.130
Calm down, brainless!

20:53.540 --> 20:55.880
You can get all the drugs you want
when we hand her over!

20:56.250 --> 21:00.670
Girl... Hand her... Have her...
Gotta have...

21:02.750 --> 21:04.210
He'll...

21:05.130 --> 21:06.630
He?

21:07.170 --> 21:08.630
He...

21:09.210 --> 21:10.420
Him...

21:12.420 --> 21:14.460
It's him!

21:15.040 --> 21:15.460
Kill! I gotta kill!

21:15.460 --> 21:17.250
Sorry about that, Great Savior.
Kill! I gotta kill!<b></b>

21:17.630 --> 21:21.420
See, he and I? We've both had a lot of work
done to the insides of our heads.

21:21.830 --> 21:25.420
He can't remember who he is,
or what he was even doing.

21:25.710 --> 21:27.170
I can't get it out of my head!

21:27.170 --> 21:28.380
I can't get it out!

21:28.380 --> 21:29.420
That...

21:29.420 --> 21:31.500
That... That...

21:50.630 --> 21:51.830
He's here.

21:53.250 --> 21:54.460
It's him!

21:54.460 --> 21:57.670
It's the Sty-Sty-Stylish...

22:05.000 --> 22:06.040
Brainless!

22:06.040 --> 22:07.960
Sty-lish...

22:10.290 --> 22:13.670
Kono subete ima kakete
All of this, I'll risk it now<b></b>

22:10.750 --> 22:12.630
Dammit! What was that?

22:12.630 --> 22:13.920
No...

22:13.920 --> 22:15.500
Who the hell are you?!

22:15.580 --> 22:24.580
Tada risou ni todoku made kono te nobashite
I just stretch out my hand until it reaches my ideals<b></b>

22:16.630 --> 22:18.080
My name is Shadow.

22:18.920 --> 22:20.380
He who lurks in the shadows

22:20.830 --> 22:22.380
in order to hunt the shadows!

22:29.670 --> 22:30.880
Shadow!

22:32.170 --> 22:37.040
The choices that extend before my eyes
Me no mae ni nobiru sentakushi<b></b>

22:37.040 --> 22:40.040
The gears of good and evil go on
Zen to aku to no haguruma wa yuku<b></b>

22:40.040 --> 22:42.830
Toward just one conclusion
Tada hitotsu no ketsumatsu e<b></b>

22:42.830 --> 22:45.500
Everything is a choice of chance
Nanimo kamo guuzen no choice<b></b>

22:45.500 --> 22:48.250
And a signal to the next step
Soshite mata tsugi e no aizu<b></b>

22:48.250 --> 22:50.880
To the edge of possibility
Kanousei no genkai made<b></b>

22:50.880 --> 22:53.540
I gaze at that destination
Sono yukusaki o mitsumete<b></b>

22:53.880 --> 22:56.500
Only one, I don't need anything else
Only one, hoka ni mo iranai<b></b>

22:56.500 --> 22:59.040
I only want to fix my gaze, to the one
To the one, dake misuetetai<b></b>

22:59.040 --> 23:01.130
I will never yield this belief and determination
Yuzure wa shinai shinnen to<b></b>

23:01.130 --> 23:04.210
I'll keep them hidden in my heart
Ketsui kono mune ni himete<b></b>

23:06.790 --> 23:11.420
Highest, highest, I'm going on

23:11.420 --> 23:17.420
Go to the shadows that are truer than truth
Shinjitsu yori shinsou no kage o yuke<b></b>

23:17.420 --> 23:22.250
Highest, highest, I'll carry on

23:22.250 --> 23:31.330
Right or wrong, if you desire, maintain your aloofness
Ze ga hi demo saa, nozomu nara kokou ni tsuranuke<b></b>
